For your Customer Management CRUD Project (Spring Boot + JPA + MySQL + Swagger), these are all APIs available in Swagger and Postman.

Swagger URL:
-------------------
http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html
Customer Management API

Base URL:

http://localhost:8080/api/customers
1) Save Customer (CREATE)
----------------------------
Method
POST
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Request Body
{
  "name": "Subham Behera",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "mobnum": "9876543210"
}
Response
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Subham Behera",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "mobnum": "9876543210"
}
Swagger
POST /api/customers
2) Get All Customers (READ)
------------------------------
Method
GET
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/customers
Response
[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Subham Behera",
    "location": "Hyderabad",
    "mobnum": "9876543210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Rahul Sharma",
    "location": "Bangalore",
    "mobnum": "9123456780"
  }
]
Swagger
GET /api/customers
3) Get Customer By ID
--------------------------
Method
GET
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Path Variable
id = 1
Response
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Subham Behera",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "mobnum": "9876543210"
}
Swagger
GET /api/customers/{id}
4) Update Customer
-------------------------
Method
PUT
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Request Body
{
  "name": "Subham Updated",
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "mobnum": "9999999999"
}
Response
{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Subham Updated",
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "mobnum": "9999999999"
}
Swagger
PUT /api/customers/{id}
5) Delete Customer
----------------------------
Method
DELETE
URL
http://localhost:8080/api/customers/1
Response
Customer Deleted Successfully...

Swagger
---------------------
DELETE /api/customers/{id}
